# Copy to .env and replace the value. Exactly 16 alphanumeric characters
# (e.g. `pwgen 16 1`). Must match `invidious_companion_key` in Invidious.
# The placeholder below is intentionally NOT a valid key (it's longer than 16
# characters and contains a hyphen) so the service refuses to start until you
# replace it with a real one.
SERVER_SECRET_KEY=replace-with-16-alphanumeric-chars
